      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "For ARC-AGI, each puzzle is a different \"game\". There is embedding layer containing a vocabulary mapping a puzzle ID to a latent, and this embedding layer has as many rows as there are puzzle variations (~1 million). Each row contains 512 float32 - for 2MB per entry.\n\n```\n>>> cp['_orig_mod.model.inner.puzzle_emb.weights'].shape\ntorch.Size([1045829, 512])\n>>> cp['_orig_mod.model.inner.puzzle_emb.weights'].dtype\ntorch.float32\n```",
      "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:59:35Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/sapientinc/HRM/issues/67#issuecomment-3413891621",
